    },
    {
      "source_id": "tmp105",
      "page": 7,
      "snippet": "The Configuration Register is an 8-bit read/write register used to store bits that control the operational modes of the temperature sensor."
    },
    {
      "source_id": "tmp105",
      "page": 7,
      "snippet": "Table 6. Configuration Register Format"
